  output_rule:
    guide bar preserved unchanged
    each source pixel projects orthogonally onto the guide; if its target column/row has a guide pixel, it lands in the adjacent cell on the same side; otherwise erased
    multiple sources projecting to same output cell merge into one pixel

generation_strategy:
